**What this does and does not establish.** It checks the emitted rule's own text
against L4 at the inputs listed above. An edit that changes the answer only at
other inputs is not caught, and a combination the solver proved impossible is
not tested.

```catala
scope FilingIsRequiredWitness1:
  definition result
    equals
      (output of FilingIsRequired with { -- category: Individual -- holds_a_licence: false -- is_dormant: false -- is_publicly_funded: false }).filing_is_required
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope FilingIsRequiredWitness1 --disable-warnings -F json
{"result":true}
```

